OL,3,ATrump to host Xi for White House talks
OL,4,Awith AI, trade and Iran among key
OL,5,Aissues
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Wednesday, Xi was greeted by Trump
OL,8,Fwith a rare airfield welcome at Joint
OL,9,FBase Andrews - watch the red carpet
OL,10,Fbeing rolled out
OL,12,FIt came as US Treasury Secretary Scott
OL,13,FBessent announced that the US and China
OL,14,Fwould extend their trade truce to
OL,15,FJanuary - it was set to expire in
OL,16,FNovember
